<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Delete Account - ConsoleHaven</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/shared.css">
</head>
<body>

    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main id="main-content">
        <section class="auth-section">
            <div class="auth-box auth-box--danger">
                <h1>DELETE ACCOUNT</h1>

                <div class="warning-panel">
                    <p class="warning-title">&#9888; This action cannot be undone</p>
                    <p>Deleting your account will permanently remove:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Your profile, username and login credentials</li>
                        <li>Your wishlist and saved items</li>
                        <li>Your order history and saved addresses</li>
                        <li>Your forum threads, blog posts and reviews</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="auth-note">
                    <p><strong>Would deactivating be enough?</strong></p>
                    <p>Deactivating hides your profile and pauses your account, but keeps your
                       data so you can return later. You can reactivate at any time by logging in.</p>
                </div>

                <% if (error) { %>
                    <p class="error-message"><%= error %></p>
                <% } %>
                
                <form class="auth-form" action="/delete-account" method="POST"
                    onsubmit="return confirm('Are you sure? This permanently deletes your account and cannot be undone.');">

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="delete-reason">Reason for leaving (optional):</label>
                        <select id="delete-reason" name="delete-reason">
                            <option value="">Prefer not to say</option>
                            <option value="unused">I no longer use the site</option>
                            <option value="privacy">Privacy concerns</option>
                            <option value="duplicate">I have another account</option>
                            <option value="other">Other</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="delete-password">Confirm your password:</label>
                        <input type="password" id="delete-password" name="deletePassword"
                               placeholder="Enter your password" required>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="delete-confirm">Type DELETE to confirm:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="delete-confirm" name="delete-confirm"
                               placeholder="DELETE" pattern="DELETE" required>
                        <small class="field-hint">This must match exactly, in capital letters.</small>
                    </div>

                    <div class="checkbox-row">
                        <label class="inline-check"><input type="checkbox" name="understand" required>
                            I understand that this permanently deletes my data</label>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--large btn--destructive">
                        PERMANENTLY DELETE ACCOUNT</button>
                </form>

                <a href="/deactivate-account" class="btn btn--outline auth-full-btn">
                    DEACTIVATE INSTEAD</a>
                <p class="auth-link"><a href="/profile">Cancel and return to profile</a></p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
